{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01723","headline":"杂曲歌辞 游侠篇 · 崔颢","name":"杂曲歌辞 游侠篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年负胆气，好勇复知机。\n仗劒出门去，孤城逢合围。\n杀人辽水上，走马渔阳归。\n错落金琐甲，蒙茸貂鼠衣。\n还家行且猎，弓矢速如飞。\n地迥鹰犬疾，草深狐兔肥。\n腰间悬两绶，转眄生光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔颢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01723.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01723","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}